nch them in the  middle and make the cutest little bow  ties around this one's a little more  time consuming so we wouldn't recommend  doing this unless you have a bunch of  friends helping you as well  but they're so cute that it's worth it  there's literally a million ways to cut  pasta so just have fun with it you know  you've done all the hard work now it's  kind of the fun part of shaping it also  like don't go too crazy it's rustic it's  handmade it's going to be beautiful it's  going to taste great while you're making  all of your shapes you want to make sure  that you have some extra flour on hand  to dust over the finished cut pasta it's  going to prevent the pasta from sticking  to itself but it's also going to  slightly dry it out a little bit that's  going to give your final pasta a nice  toothy texture so this pasta is fresh  therefore it's not going to take nearly  as long to cook as dried pasta would you  really just need a few minutes in some  salted boiling water and you want to  kind of break up the pasta before you  put it in and then you know give it a  nice stir once it's in the water as well  just like with dried pasta we want to  make sure that it's not sticking and  moving it around in the boiling water is  going to help prevent that the only way  to know when the pasta's done is to  taste it so after you know two or three  minutes in the boiling water give it a  taste see if it's done to your liking  and as always save a cup or so of the  pasta water to help finish off your  sauce later so once you have your  strained pasta you're gonna add it to  your sauce a little bit of pasta water  and cheese if you like here we use brown  butter and sage and a bit of parmesan  this is honestly a great method you're  going to get great pasta hand rolling it  but if you do this quite often or this  is something you really get into it's  honestly worth the investment getting a  pasta roller it's going to be a little  bit easier it's going to give you a  little bit more of an even result but  don't feel like the first time you're  making pasta you have to invest in this  20 30 machine honestly the satisfaction  and  the beautiful result of fresh pasta is  pretty special it doesn't have to be  perfect it's a few simple ingredients  it's  pretty much one of the best things on  the planet there are a few things better  than a warm bowl of pasta so  give it a go  try it on the weekend and list your  friends make a party out of it and you  can't go wrong with a bowl of fresh  pasta look how beautiful that is look at  that pasta it's pretty great i'm sad  we're not eating it right now because we  already ate  god my husband's lucky to be with you  yeah  i really want more pasta now i know i'm  really hungry look at the brown butter  bits on that pasta  [Music]

